	start: Time.date.timeStamp,
	end: new DateTime(Time.date).addHours(_hours).addMinutes(60 - Time.date.minute).timeStamp
}>>
<<crimeDown 5000>>

<<person>>【은는】 당신의 팔과 머리를 제자리에 맞춘 후 윗부분을 들어 올려 당신을 구속한다. <<He>>【은는】 그것을 잠그고 열쇠를 <<his>> 벨트의 사슬에 건다.
<<seize_stolen_goods>>
<br><br>

<<He>>【은는】 뒤로 물러선다. "<span class="gold">_hours시간</span> 후에 누군가 와서 풀어줄 거다." <<if $worn.handheld.name isnot "naked">><<He>>【은는】 당신의 $worn.handheld.name【을를】 본다. "그건 풀려날 때 돌려받을 거다.<</if>><<bindtemp>><<He>>【은는】 뒤도 돌아보지 않고 떠난다.
<br><br>

With <<him>> gone, the street tries to become ordinary again. Some onlookers lose interest and return to their routines, though not without a last amused glance. Others linger, pretending they only paused by chance while their eyes keep dragging back to you.
<br><br>
If anyone decided to abuse you, there would be little you could do to stop them. For now, the shame of being the first to step forward seems to hold them back. You hope it keeps holding.
<br><br>
<<endcombat>>

<<link [[다음|Pillory]]>><<endevent>><<set $pillory.audience to 1>><</link>>
<br>

