<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>

	<<beasttype>>【이가】 포기하고 군중 속으로 도망친다.
	<br><br>

	"<<pShe stranger>> <<pverb "beats" "beat" stranger>> innocent <<beastsplural>>. <<pShe stranger>> <<pverb "belongs" "belong" stranger>> up there." You hear someone shout.
	<br>
